variations in saving ratios over time, with potential peaks and valleys that would be more accurately identified in a graphical representation.\n\nI'll systematically examine potential figure placements, focusing on adjacent pages to locate chart elements. By mapping out page content and element distribution, I hope to trace the visual data's precise location.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_18ac7a679c34471c81baac13","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport json\ndata = json.load(open('/app/resources/treasury_bulletin_1990_09.json'))\n\ndoc = data.get('document', {})\nelements = doc.get('elements', [])\n\n# Check all table elements\ntables = [el for el in elements if el.get('type') == 'table']\nprint(f'Number of tables: {len(tables)}')\n\n# Check tables around page 19 (report page 5)\nfor tbl in tables:\n    page_id = tbl.get('bbox', [{}])[0].get('page_id')\n    if 18 <= page_id <= 20:\n        print(f'Table near page 19: page_id={page_id}')\n        content = tbl.get('content')\n        if content:\n            print(f'  Content: {str(content)[:200]}')\n\""}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
